<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani cotton output reaches 8.773 mln bales.</title>
<headline>Pakistani cotton output reaches 8.773 mln bales.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The state-run Cotton Export Corporation of Pakistan said on Saturday cotton output in 1996/97 (July-June) crop year had reached a provisional 8.773 million 375-lb bales by May 22, down from 9.957 million bales in the same period last year.</p>
<p>Delivery and ginning figures in million bales (year-ago):</p>
<p>		    Punjab	   Sindh	    Total</p>
<p> Delivery	 6.689 (8.179)  2.084 (1.771)  8.773 (9.957)</p>
<p> Pressed	  6.687 (8.178)  2.084 (1.771)  8.772 (9.950)</p>
<p> Mill sales     6.030 (6.983)  1.964 (1.277)  7.994 (8.266)</p>
<p> Export sales   0.008 (1.023)  0.014 (0.471)  0.022 (1.494)</p>
<p> CEC		nil   (nil)    nil   (nil)    nil   (nil)</p>
<p> Unsold	   0.650 (0.167)  0.105 (0.022)  0.755 (0.190)</p>
<p>-- Ovais Subhani 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
